module j3.ui.cssnames
    CSS named colors for `j3.ui.css`: the 148 names of CSS Color Level 4 (`rebeccapurple` included, both gray and grey).
    `namedColor` is called from `parseColor` (`j3.ui.cssvalue`), so every color value takes a name.

fn namedColor(name: string): int
    The `0xRRGGBB` value of the named color `name` (any case), or -1 when it is not a CSS color name.
